#: includes/class-admin.php:623
msgid "Model routing"
msgstr "Pemilihan model"

#: includes/class-admin.php:624
msgid "In automatic mode the fast model writes every reply. When a reply fails ContextChat's checks, is declined or is cut off, the stronger model writes it again. Most chats only ever use the fast model."
msgstr "Dalam mode otomatis, model cepat menulis setiap balasan. Jika balasan gagal dalam pemeriksaan ContextChat, ditolak, atau terpotong, model yang lebih kuat menulis ulang balasan itu. Sebagian besar chat hanya memakai model cepat."

#: includes/class-admin.php:629
msgid "Routing"
msgstr "Pemilihan"

#: includes/class-admin.php:631
